  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.4.0 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Other Changes\n* feat(file): multi-locale auto-pick and confidence scores by @edwinjhlee in https://github.com/ljh-sh/maclisten/pull/24\n* docs(security): update contact from lijunhao@ to security@x-cmd.com by @x-cmd-root in https://github.com/ljh-sh/maclisten/pull/25\n* build(deps): bump actions/dependency-review-action from 4.5.0 to 5.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ljh-sh/maclisten/pull/28\n* build(deps): bump actions/configure-pages from 5.0.0 to 6.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ljh-sh/maclisten/pull/27\n* build(deps): bump actions/deploy-pages from 4.0.5 to 5.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ljh-sh/maclisten/pull/29\n* build(deps): bump actions/upload-pages-artifact from 3.0.1 to 5.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ljh-sh/maclisten/pull/30\n* build(deps): bump actions/checkout from 6.0.3 to 7.0.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ljh-sh/maclisten/pull/26\n* chore(release): prepare v0.4.0 by @edwinjhlee in https://github.com/ljh-sh/maclisten/pull/31\n\n## New Contributors\n* @x-cmd-root made their first contribution in https://github.com/ljh-sh/maclisten/pull/25\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ljh-sh/maclisten/compare/v0.2.2...v0.4.0",
